cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Agent Injection Bench"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark that measures how often tool-using LLM agents follow instructions planted in tool
  outputs (indirect prompt injection), and how much each defense lowers that rate without hurting legitimate task
  success, in AgentDojo's simulated workspace suite.
